Step 1: Create variables

In Variables panel create:

text → String
clipboardText → String
Step 2: Add Input Dialog

Search Input Dialog → drag it into workflow.

Set:

Title: Clipboard
Label: Enter text
Result: text
Step 3: Add Set To Clipboard

Click + → search Set To Clipboard.

In Text, enter:

text

This copies the entered text to clipboard.

Step 4: Add Get From Clipboard

Click + → search Get From Clipboard.

Set Result as:

clipboardText
Step 5: Add Message Box

Click + → Message Box.

Enter:

"Clipboard Content: " + text
